      "created_at": "2017-02-06T04:23:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's both. Heck, if you get a card out and/or get out-of-turn power uses, it's possible to have all three icons activate with Primal Rush or Natural Form's Power.</p><p>If you'll excuse the pun, Hunted Naturalist is a <em>beast</em> when he can get at least one Form card out.</p>",
