      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-02-06T04:25:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>He would get to use any effects corresponding to his active forms. So if one turn you play the Crocodile form and use the base power to select Gazelle, and then on the next turn you play Primal Charge, you get to activate both the Crocodile and Gazelle effects.</p>",
